{
  "_notes": [
    "2026-06-27 Player 1 verified live on twd_160h at 0x02110A9C (0 to 761,020); the previous 0x02110A0C address remained zero. Player 2-4 follow the contiguous four-byte SAM layout and still need multiplayer confirmation.",
    "game_over uses the established SAM 0x02110904 bit 0x40 flag: set in seeded attract state and clear from Start throughout live scoring; automated drains did not reach a final return-to-attract transition.",
    "SAM stores the 4 player scores as 4 x 8-byte (64-bit little-endian) fields: stride 8, not 4. The prior stride-4/length-4 layout mis-read players 2-4 (P2 read the zero high-bytes of P1, etc.). Corrected and validated against real 2-/3-/4-player Metallica dumps (mtl_180h)."
  ],
